* Formant-cell encoder — one channel
*
* Pins: AUDIO LINE VCC VEE
*   AUDIO — speech / tone in
*   LINE  — AM packed into ~400–1200 Hz
*
* BP_in ~300–3400 Hz, carrier_tx 800 Hz, BP_line 400–1200 Hz, τ_env 10 ms.

.subckt formant_enc AUDIO LINE VCC VEE

* --- BP_in: HPF ~300 Hz then LPF ~3400 Hz (1st-order each), buffered ---
Ch1 AUDIO H1 100n
Rh1 H1 0 5.6k
Xh1 H1 HP VCC VEE HP TL072
Rl1 HP L1 4.7k
Cl1 L1 0 10n
Xl1 L1 BPIN VCC VEE BPIN TL072

Xenv BPIN ENV VCC VEE logenv TAU=10m

* Transport carrier ~800 Hz
Vctx CTX 0 SIN(0 1.0 800 0 0 0)
Rctx CTX 0 100k

Xam CTX ENV AMRAW VCC VEE am

* --- BP_line: 2nd-order-ish HPF ~400 Hz + LPF ~1200 Hz ---
Ch2a AMRAW H2a 100n
Rh2a H2a 0 4.0k
Xh2a H2a HP2a VCC VEE HP2a TL072
Ch2b HP2a H2b 100n
Rh2b H2b 0 4.0k
Xh2b H2b HP2 VCC VEE HP2 TL072
Rl2 HP2 L2 13k
Cl2 L2 0 10n
Xl2 L2 LINEDC VCC VEE LINEDC TL072
Cout LINEDC LINE 1u
Rout LINE 0 100k

.ends formant_enc
